Split the keywords into smaller clusters if needed, and for each cluster, find a representative keyword.
Return the result as a JSON object in the following format:
{
    "representative1": [cluster1 keywords],
    "representative2": [cluster2 keywords],
    ...
}

The representatives should be in Czech.
Include ALL keywords in the output, DO NOT omit any keywords. If a keyword does not fit well into any cluster,
